Package: autoreportr
Type: Package
Title: Automatic Statistical Reporting with Interactive Cards
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2026-04-05
Author: Stalec Alinkpesso
Maintainer: Stalec Alinkpesso <<stalecalinkpesso9@gmail.com>
Description: Generates an automatic HTML statistical report with 
    interactive cards, univariate statistics, missing data analysis, 
    and data quality indicators. The report includes hover effects,
    tables, and interpretations for both numeric and categorical variables.
